From cd56710518be080a6d4f1875f1a9155ca4c7cf4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lightlanguage <lightlanguage1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 19:48:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: scene delete/rewrite with generation lock protection

- Read.tsx: add delete & rewrite buttons on latest chapter only
  - rewrite auto-triggers SSE generation after rollback
  - buttons disabled during active generation (session.running)
- deps.py: extract shared generation lock (try_lock/release/is_running)
- generation.py: use shared lock from deps.py
- entities.py: check generation lock before delete/rewrite (409 if busy)
  - delete_scene: fallback to parse tick from S### ID if metadata missing
  - rewrite_scene: cleanup >= scene_tick (was >)
- status.py, projects.py: use shared lock from deps.py

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
